tip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","露西飞踢"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","루시 킥"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成一定伤害并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","필드 전체의 누적 대미지를 가장 많이 입힌 적군에게 원거리 플라잉킥을 시전해 일정 대미지를 입히고 스턴시킨다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","对全场累计伤害最高的1名敌人进行远距离的飞踢，造成240% + 20% ATK的伤害与持续2.5秒的眩晕。飞踢后露西会回到释放技能前的位置，且技能期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","필드 전체의 누적 대미지를 가장 많이 입힌 적군 1명에게 원거리 플라잉킥을 시전해 240% + 20% ATK만큼의 대미지를 입히고, 2.5초 동안 스턴시킨다. 플라잉킥 이후 루시는 원래 위치로 돌아가며 플라잉킥 사용 중에는 제어 면역 상태가 된다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":77,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":125,"end":130,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 260% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 280% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 300% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","星灵衣-水瓶座形态"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”，可以使用魔法制造水龙卷造成范围伤害，击飞敌人并使目标眩晕。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","궁극기 사용 후 성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼으로 변한다. 강력한 마법으로 물의 회오리를 만들어 목표에게 광역 대미지를 입히고 에어본시켜 스턴시킨다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自己在释放终极技能后变为“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”直至战斗结束。之后自己也能够使用水魔法制造水龙卷，对以敌人最密集处为中心的半径1格范围内的所有敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害，并使受影响的敌人被击飞并眩晕持续2秒。“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”下自身攻击距离为10。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","궁극기 사용 후 전투가 끝날 때까지 성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼으로 변한다. 이후 자신도 강력한 마법으로 물의 회오리를 만들어 적군이 가장 밀집된 곳을 중심으로 반경 1칸 범위 내 모든 적군에게 300% + 30% ATK만큼의 대미지를 입히고, 대미지를 받은 적군을 에어본시켜 2초 동안 스턴시킨다. 성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼 상태에서 자신의 공격 범위는 10이다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":78,"end":84,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":110,"end":116,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":106,"end":120,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 350% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至375% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 375% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至400% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 400% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/kr","영웅 마스터리"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/kr","자신의 급속이 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升12点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 급속이 12 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升16点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 급속이 16 증가한다."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提升20点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","전투 중, 자신의 급속이 20 증가한다."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","水流屏障"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/kr","물의 배리어"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/kr","아쿠에리아스와 성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼의 루시가 물의 배리어를 사용해 HP가 가장 낮은 아군에게 실드를 부여한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿葵亚与“星灵衣-水瓶座形态”形态下的露西，能够使用“水流屏障”为最虚弱的友军添加能够抵御450% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","아쿠에리아스와 성령복-아쿠에리아스 폼의 루시가 물의 배리어를 사용해 HP가 가장 낮은 아군에게 8초 동안 450% ATK만큼의 대미지를 막을 수 있는 실드를 부여한다."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":45,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":38,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":59,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至500% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 500% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾存在期间，被护盾保护的角色额外提升50点远程防御。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","실드가 존재하는 동안 실드로 보호받는 영웅의 원거리 방어가 추가로 50 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值提高至550% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","실드 수치가 550% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":7,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/kr","각성의 힘"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚在场，阿葵亚额外提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/kr","루시의 에너지가 상한에 도달하고 아쿠에리아스가 필드에 존재할 경우, 아쿠에리아스의 공격 속도가 추가로 증가한다."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","若露西能量达到上限且阿葵亚已经在场，阿葵亚额外提高80点攻击速度。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","루시의 에너지가 상한에 도달하고 아쿠에리아스가 필드에 존재할 경우, 아쿠에리아스의 공격 속도가 추가로 80 증가한다."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","星之大河"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/kr","에투알 플루브"]]}